    // realpathSync throws for a path that does not exist — and the file a write is ABOUT TO CREATE never
    // exists yet. So the ROOT canonicalised and the TARGET did not, every alias of the same directory
    // compared unequal, and assertNotHoi4UserDataDir / assertPathNotInGameRoot let it through.
    //
    // Reproduced against a fixture HOI4 user folder, with server.js loaded so the real guard was armed:
    // the canonical spelling was refused, while the volume's 8.3 short name AND a junction to the very
    // same directory both wrote `history/states/1082-Loas.txt` into it — the literal filename of the
