// A division_template's `override_model` names an ENTITY — "override_model = GER_infantry_entity is used to
// change the entity that is used by divisions made from this template" (HOI4 wiki). Entities are declared as
// `entity = { name = "X" pdxmesh = … }` inside gfx/entities/**.asset, across the game, its DLCs and the mod.
// Nova had no list at all for this box, so the only way to fill it was to already know a name by heart.
//
