// Hardcoded FALLBACK order, used only if live model discovery fails (offline, etc.).
// gemini-1.5-* was RETIRED (April 2025) and 404s on v1beta — never list it here.
// The 2.5 family went the same way, reported from the field in August 2026: a user's key was fine and the
// verify box told them 2.5 was no longer supported and they needed to upgrade. Numbered models in this
// list WILL age out — that is the nature of it, and why every caller must go through getGeminiModels()
// instead. Nothing here is a primary path; it exists only for the case where ListModels cannot be reached
// at all, and no name is added here without checking it against Google's live list first.
// #verify-key-uses-stale-models
// "-latest" aliases auto-track Google's newest stable, so they head the list.
