// systemPrompt and got NO syntax guidance — so live testing showed them emitting plausible-but-
// INVALID script (is_fascist, add_army_experience, fire_news_event, etc.). This shared addendum
// is appended to any custom systemPrompt so every maker gets the same correctness rails.
