          // the body's clip height from whatever element happened to sit below it, landing on a magic 200px
          // whenever nothing did. Measured against the five eventwindow.gui files installed here, that guess
          // is wrong on every single one, and wrong in BOTH directions: vanilla, Rise of Nations and Novum
